# Public release tree: track only README, docs assets, and IPA.
# Everything else (source, Xcode, scripts, DerivedData, etc.) stays private.

*
!.gitignore

# README
!README.md
!README.ja.md

# Images referenced by README
!docs/
!docs/**

# Release IPA only (not DerivedData or other build junk)
!build/
build/*
!build/*.ipa
